BoneBurst Timeline (com.module.ta-creator-boneburst-timeline)
Copyright (c) 2026, Panupun Dev

This package provides Unity Timeline integration for BoneBurst: play and mix
animations, flip the skeleton. Its behaviour matches the spine-unity
timeline extension, but it is an original work written from scratch: it
contains no code from the Spine Runtimes or the spine-unity timeline
extension and does not integrate them.

Spine is a trademark of Esoteric Software LLC. BoneBurst Timeline is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Esoteric Software LLC.

